{"status":"ok","text":"New error responses must use the body shape the app already sends: an object with an `errors` key that maps a field name to a list of messages, such as `{\"errors\":{\"body\":[\"can't be blank\"]}}`. There is no extra wrapper object.\n\nThe notes show these status codes in use today:\n- **422** for validation errors.\n- **401** for a missing or bad token.\n- **500** for any other error.\n\nThe notes do not say which status codes new error responses must use. They only describe the current codes.","citations":["56fca5d0c38febf3946eb906728edf6466844f2f7affa6afa51bf0c06c4a75e5","393892c23ed9effdb9f603d074734932012d48d12ba6ba895d4a1e47ce623cab","5d0d30c86769d603c0d941606c2f215d4396a5188621263d62f307e5ed753edc","b7c942d81054d35fb5a20d65a563e3a6d08eb87efa36a3931eb072d54c6ea588","3377450aa8045fcb31409a510d3f13d844de30971048aa0ff42baad012e20a2d","93675f1920948016d03ab63ea7c70459ff35b82fa4dd50c59f46f0c092c8bb36","b1051433c1018cd882a4285cbf93854364447d9ce2ecfdba7fac9e000c055a0b","decdddfed8ed0774182134d92f76124e3862e6749aa80d128639de915e011021","feb483ba9e884af0099f7eb7cbb2c9e6319f541554cb1db3f0d460c98cd69b11","a6319329878a687c8b41ba1d34f97a0ca89ee464dc3e815105fb92915e6f8197","53ec64222b5743305c8462f78a5b3efcc0d1d98f12791d4d4fa698ba082becfb","ea4d779c3c64ef2cb57d4c55a8dafa45d6848b92892c7db28469a1fb207e069f","52ac965308b615c08577dc39f76e77e0d3ae3dcdccc33fa1d591d0b0203351f2","de55ac294aefe87d164ad87b11defbf65ef0c6728b48720faefe04ba15660f97","be19ee4dd1cabd8735f2d30738d24e9f9f1a081bc25acc5790e9cad545e403d7","5e5f4068cec9a133cc3666d6e86f0442b8421bc12f01d7c179c6af6b8bde739e","380e54dfb511cbf3f95019e0687ee78ed430f97e5dca59db99f9030aa9ab6762","9065e6f679916c5c2247e499c4cc0cceec9faf801e891d1eee927fe8ae07759b","fcb7c2928925007a6abbbf7c8608b086e443d57c7ed1b4fef106dae797b4c91a","95f0580b94a30b0e02d555dc7416057e1fe275e09a05623fbf0b3651aed5ea75"],"subgraph_evidence_ids":[],"retrieval":{"mode":"block","seed_k":20,"source_block_policy":"always","source_blocks_used":tr